WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:02.540
In this video, I want
to familiarize you

00:02.540 --> 00:07.060
with the idea of a limit, which
is a super important idea.

00:07.060 --> 00:10.610
It's really the idea that all
of calculus is based upon.

00:10.610 --> 00:13.157
But despite being
so super important,

00:13.157 --> 00:15.740
it's actually a really, really,
really, really, really, really

00:15.740 --> 00:17.350
simple idea.

00:17.350 --> 00:19.540
So let me draw a
function here, actually,

00:19.540 --> 00:23.690
let me define a function here,
a kind of a simple function.

00:23.690 --> 00:27.460
So let's define f of x,
let's say that f of x

00:27.460 --> 00:32.846
