02:22.140 --> 02:25.430
but that matter much relative to
this function right over here.

02:25.430 --> 02:26.890
And let me graph it.

02:26.890 --> 02:31.180
So it's essentially for
any x other than 1 f

02:31.180 --> 02:33.390
of x is going to be equal to 1.

02:33.390 --> 02:35.390
So it's going to
be, look like this.

02:35.390 --> 02:40.250
It's going to look
like this, except at 1.

02:40.250 --> 02:42.430
At 1 f of x is undefined.

02:42.430 --> 02:44.590
So I'm going to put a
