02:48.810 --> 02:51.210
We don't know what this
function equals at 1.

02:51.210 --> 02:52.840
We never defined it.

02:52.840 --> 02:55.010
This definition of the
function doesn't tell us

02:55.010 --> 02:55.760
what to do with 1.

02:55.760 --> 02:58.730
It's literally undefined,
literally undefined

02:58.730 --> 03:00.740
when x is equal to 1.

03:00.740 --> 03:04.120
So this is the function
right over here.

03:04.120 --> 03:07.850
And so once again, if someone
were to ask you what is f of 1,

03:07.850 --> 03:10.340
you go, and let's say that
even though this was a function

03:10.340 --> 03:12.126
definition, you'd go,
OK x is equal to 1,

03:12.126 --> 03:15.100
oh wait there's a gap in
my function over here.

03:15.100 --> 03:17.320
It is undefined.

03:17.320 --> 03:19.440
So let me write it again.

03:19.440 --> 03:22.875
It's kind of redundant, but I'll
rewrite it f of 1 is undefined.

03:25.820 --> 03:27.770
But what if I were
to ask you, what

03:27.770 --> 03:32.320
is the function
approaching as x equals 1.

03:32.320 --> 03:35.630
And now this is starting to
