03:35.630 --> 03:38.080
So as x gets closer
and closer to 1.

03:38.080 --> 03:40.190
So as we get closer
and closer x is

03:40.190 --> 03:47.490
to 1, what is the
function approaching.

03:47.490 --> 03:49.960
Well, this entire
time, the function,

03:49.960 --> 03:51.760
what's a getting
closer and closer to.

03:51.760 --> 03:53.830
On the left hand side,
no matter how close

03:53.830 --> 03:56.080
you get to 1, as long
as you're not at 1,

03:56.080 --> 03:58.880
you're actually at f
of x is equal to 1.

03:58.880 --> 04:02.130
Over here from the right hand
side, you get the same thing.

04:02.130 --> 04:05.370
So you could say, and
we'll get more and more

04:05.370 --> 04:08.530
