going to be equal to 1,

04:31.202 --> 04:33.160
it's getting closer and
closer and closer to 1.

04:33.160 --> 04:35.490
It's actually at
1 the entire time.

04:35.490 --> 04:38.030
So in this case, we
could say the limit

04:38.030 --> 04:41.214
as x approaches
1 of f of x is 1.

04:41.214 --> 04:43.880
So once again, it has very fancy
